785
01:00:56,027 --> 01:00:56,861
<i>Sadarlah.</i>

786
01:01:10,208 --> 01:01:11,376
Aku akan menopangmu.

787
01:01:20,635 --> 01:01:21,594
Ayo berjalan bersama.

788
01:01:39,237 --> 01:01:41,364
Sebelum konferensi akademis besok,

789
01:01:41,447 --> 01:01:44,617
